<deviceset name="WCAP-PSLP_D5L5.5" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:18482328/4" prefix="C">
<description>WCAP-PSLP Aluminum Polymer Capacitors 
Low Profile  

Characteristics
Low profile product series 
Low ESR over high frequency range 
High permissible ripple current 
Mounting style: V-Chip SMT
Recommended soldering: Reflow soldering 

Applications
Low ripple voltage at the switching converter 
Filtering 
Smoothing 
Coupling 
e.g. High-end power supply, industrial computer, VGA card, charger, digital set-top box 

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WCAP-PSLP

Updated by Ella 2026-09-15
2026(C) Würth Elektronik</description>
